# Top-down (3/4 view) tiles, 16x16, the RPG Maker 2000 tile size for the
# 24x32 top-down characters. Wall faces are seen from the front, so the
# side-view props (windows, lockers, chalkboard, TV, mirror, talisman,
# geumjul) also go on wall faces. Wall tops: tiles_topdown_walltop.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_topdown.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_topdown_x4.png 4
@columns 8

